T049 prepares the v0.3.0-alpha.2 candidate by raising the source, generated
Profile, and container Go baseline from 1.26.5 to 1.26.7; coordinating all five
module versions; updating current release documentation and validation rules;
and making source-mode container acceptance use dynamically allocated loopback
ports. The hosted lifecycle test now completes one request before cancellation
so it cannot race the documented pre-start cancellation path. Framework runtime
code, public APIs, migrations, routes, and generated product behavior are
unchanged. The source digest in summary.md covers the complete candidate outside
this evidence folder.
